    "content": {
      "rendered": "<div id=\"fh-jobpost\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;background:#1E3A8A;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 18px;border-bottom:5px solid #F5B301;\"><strong style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:#FFFFFF;\">&#128421;&#65039; VIRTUAL DRIVE &ndash; Direct Interview on Google Meet | 24 Nov, 12:30&ndash;2:00 PM IST</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background:#E4F3EA;border-left:5px solid #1E8E4E;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 22px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#123D28;\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 lets you <strong>attend a direct interview online on Google Meet, 24 Nov 2026, 12:30&ndash;2:00 PM IST</strong> for the <strong>Talent Acquisition Intern</strong> role in Noida. Register on the Google Form first; no office visit is needed. Info Edge, the company behind Naukri.com, wants MBA/PGDM candidates with 0&ndash;1 year of experience for a 6-month intern/contract job that can turn full-time. The Naukri listing shows &#8377;3&ndash;4 LPA and 3 openings.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#0F3D2A;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:13px 18px;\">Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 &mdash; job details at a glance</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Company</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Info Edge (India) Ltd &ndash; parent of Naukri.com</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Role</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Talent Acquisition Intern (Non-IT Recruiter)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Drive date &amp; time</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">24 Nov 2026, 12:30 PM &ndash; 2:00 PM IST</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Interview mode</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Direct interview online &ndash; Google Meet</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Job location</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Noida (work mode not stated)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Salary / stipend</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Official: &#8377;3&ndash;4 LPA (Naukri) | Reported: &#8377;1.4&ndash;8 LPA, Info Edge interns, all roles (AmbitionBox, 4 reports)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Experience</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">0&ndash;1 year (recruitment internship preferred)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Education</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">MBA/PGDM, any specialisation</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Duration</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">6-month intern/contract; full-time conversion on performance</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Openings</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">3 | Batch: Not stated</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #0B5CFF;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 26px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(11,92,255,.12);\">\n<div style=\"background:#0B3D91;color:#ffffff;padding:16px 20px;font-weight:800;font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.4;\">🎥 Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 &ndash; Direct Interview details</div>\n<div style=\"background:#E8F0FF;padding:10px 20px;font-size:14.5px;color:#0b3d91;font-weight:600;\">Virtual Drive &ndash; attend a direct interview online on Tuesday, 24 November 2026</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 170px;background:#F5F8FE;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#33415c;\">📍 Drive type</div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 260px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">Virtual Drive &ndash; direct online interview</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 170px;background:#F5F8FE;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#33415c;\">📅 Interview date</div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 260px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">24 November 2026 (Tuesday)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 170px;background:#F5F8FE;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#33415c;\">⏰ Timing</div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 260px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">12:30 PM &ndash; 2:00 PM IST</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 170px;background:#F5F8FE;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#33415c;\">💻 Platform</div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 260px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">Google Meet (browser or Meet app)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 170px;background:#F5F8FE;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#33415c;\">🆔 Meeting code</div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 260px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">yhn-hgii-tck</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 170px;background:#F5F8FE;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#33415c;\">🔗 Meeting link</div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 260px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\"><a style=\"color:#0b5cff;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all;\" href=\"https://meet.google.com/yhn-hgii-tck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://meet.google.com/yhn-hgii-tck</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 170px;background:#F5F8FE;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#33415c;\">📝 Registration form</div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 260px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\"><a style=\"color:#0b5cff;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all;\" href=\"https://forms.gle/yNp8DbnmGPB4yBhq5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://forms.gle/yNp8DbnmGPB4yBhq5</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:12px 20px;font-size:14px;color:#33415c;background:#F5F8FE;border-top:1px solid #DCE5F5;\">Fill in the registration form, then join the Google Meet at 12:30 PM IST with your resume ready and attend the direct interview online.</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_90 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-light-blue ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Job Summary</p>\n</div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\" >Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 &ndash; full job details</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#What_you_will_do_in_the_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_role\" >What you will do in the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 role</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_eligibility\" >Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 eligibility</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_expected_salary\" >Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 expected salary</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_selection_process\" >Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 selection process</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#Documents_required_for_the_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026\" >Documents required for the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#Preparation_tips_for_the_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026\" >Preparation tips for the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#How_to_apply_for_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026\" >How to apply for Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#About_Info_Edge\" >About Info Edge</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/#Frequently_asked_questions\" >Frequently asked questions</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\"></span>Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 &ndash; full job details<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 is a same-day virtual drive for a non-IT recruitment internship, where candidates attend a direct interview online. You register through a short Google Form the recruiter added to the listing, then face the interview on one Google Meet call inside a 90-minute window. Nothing happens in person for this round.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The role offered in the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 sits in the Human Resources team and is built around volume hiring for sales and other non-technical jobs. Naukri lists it in Noida with three openings, a 0&ndash;1 year experience band and a temporary/contractual employment type. After six months, Info Edge says the intern may be moved to a full-time role if performance is good.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Online direct interview:</strong> the whole round runs on Google Meet, so you do not need to visit any office.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#FFF6E3;border-left:5px solid #E1A006;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3706;\"><strong>Check before you join:</strong> the &#8377;3&ndash;4 LPA figure sits on a 6-month intern/contract role &ndash; ask the recruiter whether it is the internship pay or the package after conversion.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFF6E3;border-left:5px solid #E1A006;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3706;\"><strong>Education filter:</strong> the only qualification listed is an MBA/PGDM in any specialisation. Graduates without a postgraduate degree are not mentioned as eligible.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"What_you_will_do_in_the_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_role\"></span>What you will do in the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 role<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Find candidates for non-IT openings through job portals, social media and employee referrals</li>\n<li>Call about 100&ndash;120 candidates a day on a dialer and screen them over the phone</li>\n<li>Run phone and face-to-face interviews to judge skills and fit</li>\n<li>Work with hiring managers to understand each opening and what the team needs</li>\n<li>Drive each requirement from the job post up to offer discussion</li>\n<li>Record every step in the applicant tracking system (ATS) so records stay complete</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_eligibility\"></span>Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 eligibility<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li><strong>Education:</strong> MBA/PGDM, any specialisation (as listed on Naukri)</li>\n<li><strong>Experience:</strong> 0&ndash;1 year; earlier recruitment work or an HR internship is asked for</li>\n<li><strong>Skills:</strong> clear spoken communication, interviewing, judging skill set and culture fit, handling several openings at once</li>\n<li><strong>Batch / passing year:</strong> Not stated</li>\n<li><strong>CGPA cut-off:</strong> Not stated</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Unconfirmed:</strong> the listing does not say whether final-year MBA students can join or only graduates. If you are still studying, confirm this with the recruiter on the call.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_expected_salary\"></span>Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 expected salary<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Official:</strong> the Naukri listing shows &#8377;3&ndash;4 LPA and does not split internship pay from post-conversion pay. <strong>Reported:</strong> AmbitionBox shows &#8377;1.4&ndash;8 LPA for Info Edge interns across all roles, based on only four reports, so use it as a loose guide. Info Edge talent acquisition staff with 2&ndash;6 years of experience report roughly &#8377;2.3&ndash;9.1 LPA on the same site.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026_selection_process\"></span>Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 selection process<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">For the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026, the company has not published the interview rounds. Based on how most recruitment internships are filled, plan for these steps:</p>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Submit the Google Form, then join the Google Meet for the direct interview</li>\n<li>A short HR chat about your background and why you want recruitment work</li>\n<li>A role-play or mock screening call to test how you speak to candidates</li>\n<li>A final talk with the hiring manager about targets and the internship terms</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Documents_required_for_the_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026\"></span>Documents required for the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Updated resume in PDF &ndash; build one free with our <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/resume-builder/\">Resume Builder</a></li>\n<li>MBA/PGDM mark sheets or your latest semester result</li>\n<li>Internship or experience letters from any recruitment work</li>\n<li>A government photo ID for identity checks</li>\n<li>A quiet room, working camera, microphone and stable internet</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Preparation_tips_for_the_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026\"></span>Preparation tips for the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Practise a 60-second <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/self-introduction-for-interview/\">self-introduction for interview</a> that explains why you want to work in recruitment</li>\n<li>Learn the full hiring cycle: sourcing, screening, scheduling, offer and joining</li>\n<li>Be ready to explain how you would make 100+ calls a day without losing quality</li>\n<li>Know the basics of Naukri, LinkedIn and Boolean search for sourcing</li>\n<li>Use our free <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/tools/\">career tools</a> to polish your resume and rehearse answers</li>\n<li>Log in 10 minutes early and test your audio on Google Meet</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"How_to_apply_for_Info_Edge_Virtual_Drive_2026\"></span>How to apply for Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Fill in the <a href=\"https://forms.gle/yNp8DbnmGPB4yBhq5\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Info Edge Google Form</a> to register for the drive</li>\n<li>Join the <a href=\"https://meet.google.com/yhn-hgii-tck\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google Meet link</a> at 12:30 PM IST on 24 November 2026 with your resume ready (the window closes at 2:00 PM)</li>\n<li>Attend the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 direct interview online and answer the recruiter&rsquo;s questions on camera</li>\n<li>See the original listing on <a href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-virtual-drive-24th-nov-talent-acquisition-intern-info-edge-noida-0-to-1-years-231126010757\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Naukri (job ID 231126010757)</a>; the contact person named there is Aashi Bhulwal</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Never pay any fee to attend. Info Edge and Naukri do not charge candidates for interviews.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#F3F6F4;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#43514A;\"><strong>Related:</strong> <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/sutherland-virtual-drive-2026/\">Sutherland Virtual Drive 2026</a> &bull; <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/hcltech-work-from-home-2026/\">HCLTech Work From Home 2026</a> &bull; <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/companies-hiring-freshers/\">Companies hiring freshers</a></p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"About_Info_Edge\"></span>About Info Edge<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Info Edge (India) Ltd is an Indian internet company with its corporate office in Noida. It runs Naukri.com, 99acres, Jeevansathi and Shiksha, and it is listed on the NSE and BSE. Through drives such as the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026, its HR teams hire in large numbers for sales and support roles across these businesses, which is why this internship centres on high-volume non-IT hiring.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Frequently_asked_questions\"></span>Frequently asked questions<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">What is the salary in the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">The Naukri listing shows &#8377;3&ndash;4 LPA (official). AmbitionBox reports &#8377;1.4&ndash;8 LPA for Info Edge interns across all roles, from only four reports. Ask whether the official figure covers the internship or only the full-time role.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Who is eligible for the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">MBA/PGDM holders in any specialisation with 0&ndash;1 year of experience. Recruitment internships help. Batch and CGPA cut-offs are not stated.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Do I need recruitment experience for this Info Edge internship?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">The listing asks for earlier experience or internships in recruitment, plus strong communication and interviewing skills. Candidates with an HR internship from their MBA have the best chance.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Where is the job location after the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">The direct interview is online on Google Meet, but the role is listed in Noida. Work mode (office or remote) is not stated, so confirm it during the call.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">How do I attend the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 interview?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Fill in the Google Form first, then join the Google Meet link at 12:30 PM IST on 24 November 2026 with your resume ready and attend the direct interview online. The window closes at 2:00 PM IST. Both links are in the meeting box at the top of this page.</p>\n</details>\n<p><a id=\"fh-apply-src\" href=\"https://meet.google.com/yhn-hgii-tck\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" hidden target=\"_blank\">Apply on official portal</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Talent Acquisition Intern (Non-IT Recruiter)\",\"description\":\"Info Edge virtual drive with a direct online interview on Google Meet, 24 November 2026, 12:30 PM to 2:00 PM IST, for a 6-month Talent Acquisition Intern / contract role in Noida with possible full-time conversion. Source and screen non-IT candidates, coordinate with hiring managers and maintain ATS records. MBA/PGDM, 0-1 year experience.\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Naukri\",\"value\":\"231126010757\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-11-23\",\"validThrough\":\"2026-11-24T14:00:00+05:30\",\"employmentType\":[\"INTERN\",\"CONTRACTOR\"],\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Info Edge (India) Ltd\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.infoedge.in\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Noida\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},\"baseSalary\":{\"@type\":\"MonetaryAmount\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"value\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"minValue\":300000,\"maxValue\":400000,\"unitText\":\"YEAR\"}},\"educationRequirements\":\"MBA/PGDM\",\"experienceRequirements\":\"0-1 years\",\"directApply\":false}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"NewsArticle\",\"headline\":\"Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 | Talent Acquisition Intern | Direct Interview on 24 Nov\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-24T07:51:00+05:30\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-24T07:51:00+05:30\",\"image\":[\"https://freshershunt.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026-s394.jpg\"],\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Freshershunt\",\"url\":\"https://freshershunt.in\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Freshershunt\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://freshershunt.in/favicon.ico\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://freshershunt.in/info-edge-virtual-drive-2026/\"}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the salary in the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The Naukri listing shows ₹3–4 LPA (official). AmbitionBox reports ₹1.4–8 LPA for Info Edge interns across all roles, from only four reports. Ask whether the official figure covers the internship or only the full-time role.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is eligible for the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"MBA/PGDM holders in any specialisation with 0–1 year of experience. Recruitment internships help. Batch and CGPA cut-offs are not stated.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need recruitment experience for this Info Edge internship?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The listing asks for earlier experience or internships in recruitment, plus strong communication and interviewing skills. Candidates with an HR internship from their MBA have the best chance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is the job location after the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The direct interview is online on Google Meet, but the role is listed in Noida. Work mode (office or remote) is not stated, so confirm it during the call.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I attend the Info Edge Virtual Drive 2026 interview?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Fill in the Google Form first, then join the Google Meet link at 12:30 PM IST on 24 November 2026 with your resume ready and attend the direct interview online. The window closes at 2:00 PM IST. Both links are in the meeting box at the top of this page.\"}}]}</script></p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" class=\"sharethis-inline-share-buttons\" ></div>",
